    "note": "Signed act 04/18/2025. Part 5 of article 12 is repealed and reenacted (all capitals). Quotes are excerpts from 18-12-502 and 18-12-503; the bill also has a vendor certification form (18-12-504) and vendor offence (18-12-505) not quoted. Fragments quoted from 18-12-502(2)(b) end before the five-year promoter ban clause."
